Whichever finishes first when run on the same input.

>
> 2.       If I use input format function to do the task, where the execution of cleaning is (is it in Hadoop or local)

Both distributed. But the input format is meant to isolate your task logic from the format. Imagine one day you want to do exactly the same task, but the data comes in a different format. You should be able to change the input format and leave the map function alone. There is more than the I/O relation to software engineering.

>
>
