Antonio,

I'm still toying with some configuration changes, but it seemed like from your last message in the thread you indicated that the SO answer was a "great answer for a regular java MR program, but not for a streaming-based one" (a la rmr2).

If it turns out that I'm not tripping over my own feet on this one, I'll open a separate issue. :)

